  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "The Deceive Summary page (Deceive > Summary) allows you to view and manage decoy deployment. On the Summary page, you can do the following:"
    },
    {
      "item": "View the deployment health status.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You can view the deployment health status of all the Decoy Connectors and service back ends.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To view the deployment health status:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Deceive > Summary.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ],
        [
          16,
          23
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click a deployment health status:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Ready for deployment: All the Decoy Connectors and service back ends are up and running.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Action Required: Some or all Decoy Connectors and service back ends are down and need your attention.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "The deployment health status of the Decoy Connectors and service back ends appears.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Done.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Start or stop decoys.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Before you configure a network (Internal and Zero Trust Network) or Threat Intelligence (TI) decoy, you must stop all active decoys, make the required changes, and then restart the decoys for the configurations to take effect.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Starting and stopping decoys impacts network and TI decoys only. Other decoys such as landmine, AD, etc. are not impacted.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Stopping Decoys",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "To stop a decoy:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Deceive > Summary.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ],
        [
          16,
          23
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "If there are any decoys that are currently active, click Stop Decoys.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          57,
          68
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "In the confirmation window, click OK.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          34,
          36
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Starting Decoys",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "To start a decoy:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Deceive > Summary.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ],
        [
          16,
          23
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Start Decoys.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          18
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "In the confirmation window, click OK.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          34,
          36
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "View and analyze deployment logs.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You can view and analyze decoy deployment logs to troubleshoot deployment issues. You can use the logs to debug the components that caused an error during the decoy deployment.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To view the decoy deployment logs:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Deceive > Summary.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ],
        [
          16,
          23
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click View Deployment Logs.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          26
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "The Deployment Logs window appears. The red text indicates deployment issues.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Show Only Failed to view only the failed deployment log details.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          22
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}
